# 32_hypnagogic_visions_RGB.ledc — Hypnagogic Visions, RGB inner/outer build
# RGB variant of 32_hypnagogic_visions. Audio + speech IDENTICAL (binaural theta bridge +
# pink bed). Warm eyes-closed imagery field: inner ring amber (mask 9, 255,160,32), outer
# ring deep amber (mask 6, 255,80,0), 180 antiphase, SINE gate, with the 0.6 Hz flicker
# jitter kept (anti-habituation) — a warm radial dream field. Warm amber is NON-saturated
# (safe to flicker); all rates <=10 Hz; brightness <=30%. See base header for safety.
#
# LED: time freq duty bright R G B mask [env phase attack jitter]

# --- Induction: amber 10 Hz field, jitter, fade in ---
0 10 50 >0 255 160 32 9 1 0 3 0.6:30000     # inner amber: 10 Hz sine, flicker jitter 0.6 Hz/30 s
0 10 50 >0 255 80 0 6 1 180 3 0.6:30000     # outer deep-amber: antiphase
A 0 246 0 >0 0 1 256 0                       # ch1 binaural: carrier 246 / R256 => 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in
A 0 200 0 >0 0 2 0 5                         # ch2 soft pink-noise bed; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 65 "Eyes closed. Let the amber field fill your vision, and simply watch what arises."
15000 10 50 28 255 160 32 9 1 0 3 0.6:30000  # inner: 28% reached
15000 10 50 28 255 80 0 6 1 180 3 0.6:30000  # outer
A 60000 246 0 90 0 1 256 0                   # ch1 vol settled
A 60000 200 0 40 0 2 0 5                     # ch2 pink settled

# --- Descent to theta twilight (beat 10->6) ---
A 120000 >246 0 90 0 1 256 0                 # carrier 246->250 (beat 10->6)
120000 >10 50 28 255 160 32 9 1 0 3 0.6:30000   # inner: flicker 10->6, jitter continues
120000 >10 50 28 255 80 0 6 1 180 3 0.6:30000   # outer
S 120000 default 65 "Drifting down into the twilight. Images may drift and shift; let them come and go."

# --- Imagery hold (6 Hz, breathing brightness, jitter on) ---
A 480000 250 0 90 0 1 256 0                  # beat settled 6 Hz
480000 6 50 ~20:32:10000 255 160 32 9 1 0 3 0.6:30000   # inner: 6 Hz, 0.1 Hz brightness breath
480000 6 50 ~20:32:10000 255 80 0 6 1 180 3 0.6:30000   # outer
S 480000 default 65 "Rest here at the threshold. Faces, patterns, landscapes — witness them without grasping."
S 900000 default 65 "Let the slow breath of the light carry you. The images renew themselves; stay soft and curious."

# --- Gentle rise (beat 6->9) ---
A 1320000 >250 0 90 0 1 256 0               # carrier 250->247 (beat 6->9)
1320000 >6 50 28 255 160 32 9 1 0 3 0.6:30000   # inner: 6->9, steady dim
1320000 >6 50 28 255 80 0 6 1 180 3 0.6:30000   # outer
S 1320000 default 65 "Gently rising now, carrying the imagery with you toward waking clarity."

# --- Soft fade ---
A 1500000 247 0 >90 0 1 256 0               # beat alpha 9; vol fade
1500000 9 50 >28 255 160 32 9 1 0 3 0        # inner: brightness fade, jitter released
1500000 9 50 >28 255 80 0 6 1 180 3 0        # outer
A 1500000 200 0 >40 0 2 0 5                  # pink bed fade
S 1500000 default 65 "The field fades. Open your eyes when you are ready, calm and rested."
A 1620000 247 0 0 0 1 256 0                  # ch1 vol 0
1620000 9 50 0 255 160 32 9 1 0 3 0          # inner off
1620000 9 50 0 255 80 0 6 1 180 3 0          # outer off
A 1620000 200 0 0 0 2 0 5                    # pink vol 0
